{"game": "mass-effect-3", "language": "english", "appid": 1238020, "month": "2024-03", "window": 1, "start_date": 1709251200, "end_date": 1711929599, "month_true_total": 17, "quota": 17, "returned": 17, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 19:54:34 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "161833572", "author": {"steamid": "76561198312233815", "personaname": "Alphaeuseuss", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198312233815/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 4682, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4682, "last_played": 1711832999, "avatar": "ce24d1f46b522de3c471592b7739beee5aac892f"}, "language": "english", "review": "78 hours... _on steam_... I've ripped through these games so many times, and I'll keep coming back for more. glory to shep.", "timestamp_created": 1711832882, "timestamp_updated": 1711832882, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161793463", "author": {"steamid": "76561198170706651", "personaname": "Professor_Boris", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198170706651/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 58, "playtime_forever": 47467, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 41966, "last_played": 1766287625, "avatar": "b2b94eac92551a9ac96f030ad0d50cc2d40766b6"}, "language": "english", "review": "Due to EA being EA your Ol' Pal Brois does not recommend this game. The game requires a constant connection to EA servers via the EA App (makes Origin look good) or if you have the tech know-how, Origin.\r\n\r\nThere are many users having key issues when buying here on Steam due to the Origin/EA App ongoing issues. Don't blame Steam here.\r\n\r\nJust watch long plays on YouTube to avoid installing sus launchers on your machine.\r\n\r\nThe story, graphics, music etc is good.", "timestamp_created": 1711794078, "timestamp_updated": 1711794078, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.57951509952545166", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161660315", "author": {"steamid": "76561198805173832", "personaname": "BigCunggus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198805173832/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 110, "playtime_forever": 2833, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2833, "last_played": 1711640964, "avatar": "b2a734431d40a6c110b7c09b1b3b65ad5819c79f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Had to buy this one cuz Legendary edition can be ♥♥♥♥♥♥ up sometimes and it required 110gb downloading. EA app also require constant fast internet which is i never understand why, i can login rockstar, ubisoft and cyberpunk launcher with no problem whatsoever. The problem with EA app is the thing was made by cheap software engineer.", "timestamp_created": 1711641825, "timestamp_updated": 1711641825, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.54356849193572998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161618350", "author": {"steamid": "76561198353917983", "personaname": "Lytegreen", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198353917983/", "num_games_owned": 75, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1354, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1354, "las