0293542, "timestamp_updated": 1710293542, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160324659", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970804918", "personaname": "Lord Rothmaller", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970804918/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 2812, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 310, "last_played": 1779760458, "avatar": "95d8f1c00bbdc43e289e494f3dad027a6f930ac4"}, "language": "english", "review": "I Own Over 300 Games Mass Effect I,2 And 3 Are My All Time Favorite Games", "timestamp_created": 1710159686, "timestamp_updated": 1710159686, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501380264759063721", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160287894", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043985291", "personaname": "Korig", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Korig/", "num_games_owned": 3356, "num_reviews": 273, "playtime_forever": 3568, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 260, "last_played": 1732009558, "avatar": "3abae822a682eff3b85fc2bcf5783a63965a78dc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not really a positive review, in fact if we are talking about the Single Player campaign & the end to the Mass Effect Trilogy I have a lot to say thats negative. This is more a PSA on how to get Controller Support working in Multiplayer...which is the only reason to buy this version of the game...\r\n\r\nTurns out EA (lol) doesn't support controller in the PC version of OG ME3. On top of that they not only bind Sprint/Use/Dodge all to one key permanently but there are a ton of bugs with remapping key bindings I encountered.\r\n\r\nInstalled this mod to enable Controller support for ME3 on Steam & it plays great. Just need this & the ME3Tweaks Mod Manager which is linked when you go to download it:\r\n>Download the ME3Tweaks Mod Manager\r\n>Link the Mod Manager to your Nexus Mods Account\r\n>Download the Multiplayer Native Controller Support\r\n>Via the Manager Apply the Mod\r\n>Launch the game & it should say \"MP Controller Support\" on the Title screen & Main Menu to know its installed\r\n\r\nTurns it into the Console version effectively, to change visual Settings since they are now disabled you'll have to launch the Tool (second option) when launching via Steam to mess with any visual settings, it took some tinkering on my end (controller stopped working & had to disable/enable Borderless mode to fix) but now the game plays great despite EA's laziness:\r\nhttps://www.nexusmods.com/masseffect3/mods/374?tab=description\r\n\r\nHope you have fun in the multiplayer Spectres, punt kick the Catalyst Kid for me.", "timestamp_created": 1710101522, "timestamp_updated": 1710101522, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.459846049547195435", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160262450", "author": {"steamid": "76561199055961111", "personaname": "Mister DeEgg", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199055961111/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 159, "playtime_forever": 10, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5, "last_played": 1725058610, "avatar": "ae406e4f68220ecf0c77bdd7dbd883225c5472d4"}, "language": "english", "review": "Cant launch the game beause EA want a product key from me and they dont even let me enter one becuase its messed up and it doesnt work. Great work EA", "timestamp_created": 1710078251, "timestamp_updated": 1710078251, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 53, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.769882500171661377", "comment_count": 5, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160228761", "author": {"steamid": "76561199185824510", "personaname": "Detect!Ve", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199185824510/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 4873, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 137, "last_played": 1716021223, "avatar": "773176a8c6a6a234db27a564ecd732038f14fdeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Multiplayer is great !!!!!!!!!!! still on 2024 !!!!!!!!!!", "timestamp_created": 1710037643, "timestamp_updated": 1710037643, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 24, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.705360352993011475", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160223204", "author": {"steamid": "76561198007859755", "personaname": "Nicsienieda", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Nicsienieda/", "num_games_owned": 442, "num_reviews": 54, "playtime_forever": 5805, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1274, "deck_playtime_at_review": 1274, "last_played": 1768776278, "avatar": "9bc0fc848f87c7316dc9505e610ec51751956793"}, "language": "english", "review": "It is really difficult for me to review this game because of what happened on release. Having played by then the previous games four times each, I wanted something both familiar and unique. I know for a fact I was at times pedantically critical of it and unfair towards it. I am also unable to separate it from the release controversy, from what I expected and got instead, and from personal life events. I was leaving my country for a year and so I brute forced the entire game in several days because I wouldn't be able to play it abroad. For all these reasons, I ended up playing Mass Effect 3 just once until only very recently. And so I'm also unable to say with how much rose nostalgia has tinted my glasses in regards to assessing the previous games.\n\nUnfortunately, I still don't think this game has an identity or soul. That extra something that can transport you to some deeply ingrained vibe. Mass Effect 1, with its synths, dark blue, newness, MAKO exploration. Mass Effect 2, the Suicide Mission but especially the bewildering cinematography. MOM, I'M PLAYING THE MOVIE! Mass Effect 3? Maybe the dreams? Nah, nothing, it's just a saturated Mass Effect 2, with an obnoxious multiplayer inclusion. The game is just a conclusion of threads, at times quite successful at it, but ultimately nothing singular.\n\nIt's so sad it was decided this needs to be pushed out as soon as possible. This series deserved better. It was successful by every metric but still afraid to oppose the trend chasers at EA, who wanted multiplayer and were afraid of a new console generation. This was such a mammoth of an IP, it would've sold millions on old hardware regardless OR it would've sold new hardware on its own. And with just that bit of extra time, maybe it could've found something of its own to express too.\n\nIn hindsight, many a series ended on a worse note, I guess. \n\nP.S. The multiplayer is really good and still somehow kicking! The last truly alive part of this epic journey wriggling and fighting against the ultimate inexorable conclusion by the critic. Let us toast to that!", "timestamp_created": 1710030502, "timestamp_updated": 1763458198, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": true, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "160157002", "author": {"steamid": "76561198111403933", "personaname": "TheVVarrior", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198111403933/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 5980, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2998, "last_played": 1718290008, "avatar": "ada139b3ad7bee37bb88d6fc4c0848c73aaa1ea8"}, "language": "english", "review": "I had the bug that was asking for the product key but thanks to EA support it was resolved which lets me get back to the multiplayer that I love! Here's a link to the page that resolved my issue.\nhttps://answers.ea.com/t5/Battlefield-3/Battlefield-3-BOUGHT-via-Steam-or-EA-app-Keeps-Asking-For-A/td-p/12694524", "timestamp_created": 1709959917, "timestamp_updated": 1709959917, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.57684248685836792", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "159604352", "author": {"steamid": "76561199098250895", "personaname": "Mr Selfdestruct", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199098250895/", "num_games_owned": 183, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 2063, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 103, "last_played": 1778837703, "avatar": "e635f6ebf4636c08ac2cf8360d14d754238c98ee"}, "language": "english", "review": "came back for the multiplayer", "timestamp_created": 1709296352, "timestamp_updated": 1709296352, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 41, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.779638826847076416", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1591887286", "reactions": []}]}